&_nc_oc=AdqsFZYy2nJSpV_n1WVgBWWtocNkG_0KOij_8U7MyDnnVAxETkV3zSG07kLIK0UN8uE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKRLwMRbWLlwfGBIkSlMvIiLPenPDgVH1E4D7mAsQhTiA&oe=6AB3C7D8"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_05_comfort_menu.png", "id": "2058621092196858", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307309_2058621095530191_366338629048714481_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XpOsE8E16nQQ7kNvwHl6mKP&_nc_oc=AdqMNE0JytjayRiMvEKafr8btcF0Hw8hXCo7LK1dv6aCLtW-A6tdoBKlCR6rHhot5qo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLn5UQXgFNYLN_Nyp1up5iJZu1AcWHEl-4lZA-j8ysxWQ&oe=6AB3F87C"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_01_coin_trail.png", "id": "888256780666510", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673780696_888256783999843_1367271276265712207_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LWUWf0QQQPgQ7kNvwF06-24&_nc_oc=AdqVwncTW2yG6exomIeWXN7Ch0-WiyzuxcCnVqp_XP41eFw96OcwRPMO4iDv3IFM6Ww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL_JKE0WPnMPo18Wy_GSWHc0p0LFaW-C3x4EoNdraKPVA&oe=6AB3F016"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_03_level_vista.png", "id": "1295268972503088", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312310_1295268975836421_9133143210799255965_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6BMva8cJLfEQ7kNvwG-BVWU&_nc_oc=AdpnQ2ZK2-P3LIY5x6_DLkEkMYd_Ak5-7-wRhreQ9evtGSJjDj_IGT2DHNfYK3XgVaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKFcvznr7SH46gDKlVMuM13kemDub28hspyiFjmAgFqHQ&oe=6AB3C85E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1602252444830748", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619681_1602252448164081_2145720626556957219_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FTp8ghQJOJIQ7kNvwECFHJm&_nc_oc=Adrl7YjJnNcnuFnQrNpJgPUNORy71VWp-G8qIG6BRYYlTFQMLjKBvxrD7RiXJIa6dB8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJQOk5npfKvvPFCWLaUbENpfBjmjxK_7XMRKKLiYNARVw&oe=6AB3D9A2"}, "display_name": "Nimbi's Adventures", "keywords": ["platformer", "family", "adventure"], "long_description": "THE BREAKOUT VR PLATFORMER OF THE YEAR\n\nRemember the first time a video game made you smile? Nimbi's Adventures brings that feeling back... except this time you are inside the world. Join Nimbi, an adorable white mushroom with a red polka-dot cap, on a third-person 3D platforming adventure built for Meta Quest. Every level feels like a life-size toy diorama: castles towering over you, pipes full of secrets, and waves sparkling beneath wooden piers.\n\nCLASSIC MECHANICS, BRAND-NEW FEELING\n- Run, jump and chain precise double jumps.\n- Attack enemies and smash breakable blocks full of surprises.\n- Collect regular and red coins: each one buzzes in your hand with haptic feedback.\n- Gather 60 coins to transform into GOLDEN NIMBI: your attack shatters blocks and defeats enemies in your path.\n\nTWO WORLDS TO EXPLORE\n- Hills: green meadows, castles and mysterious pipes.\n- Beach: wooden piers, warm sand and sparkling water.\n- Your progress is saved: clear the Hills to unlock the Beach.\n- Generous checkpoints and a goal flag to celebrate every victory.\n\nREAL VR COMFORT\n- Orbital camera with 30-degree snap turns: no continuous rotation, no queasiness.\n- Instant one-button recentering.\n- World-anchored HUD, never glued to your face.\n- Comfortable menus: just point with your controller.\n- Native 72-120 Hz on Meta Quest for constant smoothness.\n\nFUN FOR ALL AGES\nColorful, cheerful and easy to learn: a perfect first VR game, great for kids and for lifelong platformer fans alike. Classic platfor", "short_description": "Jump into a life-size toy world. Run, double-jump and go golden with Nimbi in a comfort-first third-person VR platformer made for Meta Quest.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/2f4ad790-50df-44e8-a18d-18378f51